<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
    
<main class="travel-smart-page">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="ts-hero">
    <div class="ts-hero-content">
      <span class="ts-eyebrow">YOUR JORDAN TRAVEL GUIDE</span>

      <h1>
        Travel smart.<br>
        <em>Experience more.</em>
      </h1>

      <p>
        A few helpful tips to make your journey through Jordan
        smoother, easier, and more memorable.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="ts-hero-note">
      <span>01 / THE ESSENTIALS</span>
      <span>PLAN LESS. EXPERIENCE MORE.</span>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- Before You Go -->
  <section class="ts-section" id="travel-tips">

    <div class="ts-section-heading">
      <span class="ts-eyebrow">START HERE</span>
      <h2>Before you <em>go.</em></h2>
      <p>A little preparation goes a long way.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ts-tips-grid">

      <article class="ts-tip-card">
        <span class="ts-tip-number">01</span>
        <h3>Travel Documents</h3>
        <p>
          Check your passport validity, entry requirements,
          and visa arrangements before travelling.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="ts-tip-card">
        <span class="ts-tip-number">02</span>
        <h3>What to Pack</h3>
        <p>
          Bring comfortable walking shoes, sun protection,
          and layers suitable for the season and destination.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="ts-tip-card">
        <span class="ts-tip-number">03</span>
        <h3>Plan Your Budget</h3>
        <p>
          Allow for accommodation, transportation, meals,
          entrance fees, and activities.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="ts-tip-card">
        <span class="ts-tip-number">04</span>
        <h3>Stay Connected</h3>
        <p>
          Check mobile data and roaming options before arrival.
          Download useful maps for offline access.
        </p>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- Getting Around -->
  <section class="ts-transport-section">

    <div class="ts-transport-content">
      <span class="ts-eyebrow">GETTING AROUND</span>

      <h2>Find your<br><em>own way.</em></h2>

      <p>
        Jordan offers different ways to explore, depending on
        your itinerary, budget, and preferred pace.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="ts-transport-list">

      <article class="ts-transport-item">
        <span class="ts-transport-icon">01</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Private Driver</h3>
          <p>
            A convenient option for visiting several destinations
            on a flexible itinerary.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="ts-transport-item">
        <span class="ts-transport-icon">02</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Rental Car</h3>
          <p>
            Ideal for travellers who prefer exploring independently.
            Check local driving rules and rental requirements.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="ts-transport-item">
        <span class="ts-transport-icon">03</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Public Transport</h3>
          <p>
            Buses and other services can suit selected routes.
            Check schedules and availability in advance.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>



  <!-- Quick Checklist -->
  <section class="ts-checklist-section">

    <div>
      <span class="ts-eyebrow">ONE LAST THING</span>
      <h2>Your travel<br><em>checklist.</em></h2>
      <p>Make sure the essentials are covered before you leave.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ts-checklist">
      <label>
        <input type="checkbox">
        <span>Passport and travel documents</span>
      </label>

      <label>
        <input type="checkbox">
        <span>Accommodation and transport bookings</span>
      </label>

      <label>
        <input type="checkbox">
        <span>Comfortable shoes and suitable clothing</span>
      </label>

      <label>
        <input type="checkbox">
        <span>Phone charger and power bank</span>
      </label>

      <label>
        <input type="checkbox">
        <span>Water bottle and sun protection</span>
      </label>

      <label>
        <input type="checkbox">
        <span>Travel insurance and emergency contacts</span>
      </label>
    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="ts-final-cta">
    <span class="ts-eyebrow">YOUR JOURNEY, YOUR WAY</span>

    <h2>Still have <em>questions?</em></h2>

    <p>
      Get in touch to discuss your plans and make the most
      of your time in Jordan.
    </p>

    <a href="/contact" class="ts-button ts-button-light">
      CONTACT ARSALAN <span>↗</span>
    </a>
  </section>

</main>



    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>